@startuml
title SC-ORD-019 — A cancellation meets a silent inventory
actor Customer as C
actor Administrator as A
participant "Order\n(cancel saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Notification" as N

C -> O : CancelOrder
note over O : order CANCELING\nsaga RETURNING_STOCK
O ->> I : ReturnStock (first)
note over I #ECEFF1 : down: the message waits
... review deadline ...
O -> O : review deadline reached
note over O #FFF8E1 : SUSPENDED, remembers RETURNING_STOCK\norder UNDER_REVIEW
O ->> N : OrderPutUnderReview
A -> O : RetryOrderUnderReview, with a comment
note over O : RETURNING_STOCK\nnew review deadline
O ->> I : ReturnStock (second)
== the inventory is back ==
note over I : first ReturnStock: units back on hand,\nreservation RETURNED
I ->> O : StockReturned
note over O : REFUNDING_PAYMENT
O ->> P : RefundPayment
note over I : second ReturnStock: already RETURNED,\nthe stock does not change
I ->> O : StockReturned
note right of O : recorded, no effect
P ->> O : PaymentRefunded
note over O #C8E6C9 : COMPLETED\norder CANCELED
O ->> N : OrderCanceled
@enduml
